---
description: |
  Reduces the volume of HarfangLab OCSF events for a SIEM. The operator
  summarizes Network Activity and HTTP Activity, and deduplicates Process
  Activity and Module Activity, with
  `harfanglab::ocsf::summarize_network`, `harfanglab::ocsf::summarize_http`,
  `harfanglab::ocsf::deduplicate_processes`, and
  `harfanglab::ocsf::deduplicate_modules`. Events of all other classes, such
  as findings, API activity, DNS activity, and authentications, pass through
  unchanged.
args:
  named:
    - name: network_window
      type: duration
      default: 5min
      description: Width of the Network Activity summary windows.
    - name: http_window
      type: duration
      default: 5min
      description: Width of the HTTP Activity summary windows.
    - name: process_window
      type: duration
      default: 1h
      description: Width of the Process Activity deduplication windows.
    - name: module_window
      type: duration
      default: 1d
      description: Width of the Module Activity deduplication windows.
    - name: tolerance
      type: duration
      default: 5min
      description: How long a window waits for late events of its host.
---

harfanglab::ocsf::summarize_network window=$network_window,
  tolerance=$tolerance
harfanglab::ocsf::summarize_http window=$http_window, tolerance=$tolerance
harfanglab::ocsf::deduplicate_processes window=$process_window,
  tolerance=$tolerance
harfanglab::ocsf::deduplicate_modules window=$module_window,
  tolerance=$tolerance
